X men vs Sentinel

I grew up watching the 90s x-men cartoon on tv. This  was such a dream come true for me  to get to animate x-men battling on a sentinel! I am aware it's a little bit big on the scale but it made it more fun!

This is also the longest runner I ever made with this many characters. Actually  this is probably the shot that I made with this many characters!

I hope you enjoy it! 

