Monsters Hunter Elsa!

Animated by human artists with no AI.

I love the Man-Spider! It originated from the 90s animated series later adapted into the comics. I always wanted to animate him! He created a lot of challenges in animation, mainly creating appealing silhouettes. His extra arms constantly cause stacking or repetitive symmetrical poses so we had to find creative solutions.. (Breaking the rig!) To make sure everything flowed nicely and read accurately. Also making the sequence on 2s helped out with this! 

It was the perfect time to animate some Marvel Monsters for Celebrating the Arrival of Elsa into marvel rivals! 

This is to date our longest animation at 44seconds that we produced from start to finish in 30days!

I hope you enjoy it and Thank you Marvel Rivals for sponsoring this madness!

